pdf-page-merger (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial local release.
  * Merge multiple PDF files into one document.
  * Reorder individual pages with draggable thumbnails.
  * Unlock encrypted PDFs with a per-file password prompt.
  * Render page thumbnails through poppler.
  * Write the merged PDF atomically.

